{
  "_about": "The fractal window's recipe for every page: which fractal, and which of the room's own custom properties it is drawn in (ground, then the inks it cycles through). tools/fractals.py writes each one onto the switch in that page's sign-off and refuses a page with no entry here, a key a kind does not take, a colour love.css does not declare, and two rooms with the same picture. An entry that is `off` says why the room has no window. The limit that stops the picture flashing is in fractal.js and is counted by tools/fractal.test.mjs; nothing here can loosen it. Recipes were chosen by rendering them, 2026-09-27, and are not claims about any room.",
